<title>USA: American Airlines Nov load factor rises.</title>
<headline>American Airlines Nov load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's American Airlines said Monday its November load factor increased to 65.8 percent from 64.9 percent for November 1995.</p>
<p>Year-to-date, the airline's load factor increased to 68.5 percent from 66.4 percent.</p>
</text>
